Field Type Description <code>downloaded_count</code> <code>int</code> Total number of successfully decoded text files ingested into <code>files</code>. <code>skipped_count</code> <code>int</code> Count of skipped files (retained for backward schema compatibility; always <code>0</code> in stats dictionary). <code>skipped_files</code> <code>list</code> List of skipped file paths (retained for schema compatibility; always empty list in stats dictionary). <code>base_path</code> <code>str \| None</code> Root subpath used when <code>use_relative_paths=True</code>; otherwise <code>None</code>. <code>include_patterns</code> <code>set[str] \| None</code> Normalized set of glob include patterns applied during ingestion. <code>exclude_patterns</code> <code>set[str] \| None</code> Normalized set of glob exclude patterns applied during ingestion. <code>source</code> <code>str</code> (optional) Set to <code>"ssh_clone"</code> if ingested via the GitPython clone branch. Omitted on API traversals. <code>error</code> <code>str</code> (optional) Error description string if the SSH clone operation failed during execution. <p>Example Structure: <pre><code>{
    "files": {
        "pydantic/main.py": "from typing import Any...",
        "pydantic/types.py": "class ConstrainedInt:..."
    },
    "stats": {
        "downloaded_count": 2,
        "skipped_count": 0,
        "skipped_files": [],
        "base_path": "pydantic",
        "include_patterns": {"*.py", "*.md"},
        "exclude_patterns": None
    }
}
</code></pre></p>
